---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Contact Us — ImgFeel"
  description="Contact the ImgFeel team for customer support, bug reports, feature suggestions, partnership inquiries, or feedback."
  canonicalUrl="https://imgfeel.com/contact/"
>
  <h1>Contact Us</h1>
  <p class="last-updated"><strong>Last Updated:</strong> August 16, 2026</p>

  <p>
    We value your feedback, suggestions, and questions. Whether you've encountered an issue while using one of our image tools, have an idea for a new feature, or want to discuss business opportunities, we're here to assist you.
  </p>

  <h2>Primary Contact Method</h2>
  <p>
    The fastest and most direct way to get in touch with our team is via email. Please send your inquiries to our primary support address below:
  </p>

  <div class="contact-box">
    <h3>Direct Email Support</h3>
    <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:business.rajbhar@gmail.com">business.rajbhar@gmail.com</a></p>
    <p><strong>Response Time:</strong> We typically respond to all inquiries within <strong>24 to 48 hours</strong> (Monday through Friday).</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Why You Might Contact Us</h2>
  <p>Feel free to reach out to us regarding:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Bug Reports & Technical Issues:</strong> If a tool is not working as expected on your specific device or browser, let us know so we can investigate and deploy a fix.</li>
    <li><strong>Feature Suggestions & Tool Requests:</strong> Tell us what additional image formats, compression modes, or dimensions presets you'd love to see on ImgFeel.</li>
    <li><strong>Business & Partnership Inquiries:</strong> Inquiries regarding advertising, collaborations, integrations, or media coverage.</li>
    <li><strong>Privacy & Legal Questions:</strong> Any questions regarding our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>, <a href="/terms-and-conditions/">Terms & Conditions</a>, or <a href="/cookie-policy/">Cookie Policy</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>General Feedback:</strong> Let us know what you think of the user interface and performance.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Tips for Faster Support</h2>
  <p>
    If you are reporting a technical bug or unexpected conversion result, including the following details in your email helps us diagnose the problem much faster:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>The specific tool you were using (e.g. "HEIC to JPG Converter" or "CM/MM Resizer")</li>
    <li>Your operating system (e.g. Windows 11, macOS, Android, iOS)</li>
    <li>Your browser and version (e.g. Google Chrome, Safari, Firefox, Edge)</li>
    <li>The file format and approximate dimensions/size of the image you were processing</li>
    <li>A description or screenshot of any error messages displayed on screen</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    Thank you for using and supporting <strong>ImgFeel</strong>!
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
